    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.049" end="00:08.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You have no heart)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.560" end="00:14.051" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:14.051" end="00:17.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pretty ho gon' ask me if I'm famous (Okay)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.320" end="00:19.873" ttm:agent="v1">Gas got me sedated, put my blunt out on the pavement</p>
      <p begin="00:19.873" end="00:23.870" ttm:agent="v1">She said she in love, I fell in love with my hiatuses</p>
      <p begin="00:23.870" end="00:27.933" ttm:agent="v1">Julie think I'm conceited but askin' what the latest been</p>
      <p begin="00:27.933" end="00:30.500" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know, just chasing it, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:30.500" end="00:32.391" ttm:agent="v1">I really need me a bad bitch, um</p>
      <p begin="00:32.391" end="00:34.178" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty with similar habits, um</p>
      <p begin="00:34.178" end="00:36.062" ttm:agent="v1">Sex, money, drugs, you can have it, um</p>
      <p begin="00:36.062" end="00:37.936" ttm:agent="v1">She need to know she a bad bitch, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:37.936" end="00:39.961" ttm:agent="v1">I really need me a bad bitch, um</p>
      <p begin="00:39.961" end="00:41.807" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty with similar habits, um</p>
      <p begin="00:41.807" end="00:43.562" ttm:agent="v1">Sex, money, drugs, you can have it, um</p>
      <p begin="00:43.562" end="00:45.471" ttm:agent="v1">She need to know she a bad bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:45.471" end="00:47.336" ttm:agent="v1">I'm getting high 'cause I need to be up</p>
      <p begin="00:47.336" end="00:49.342" ttm:agent="v1">She got a man, but still hittin' me up</p>
      <p begin="00:49.342" end="00:51.170" ttm:agent="v1">She off the Henny, she want a new cup</p>
      <p begin="00:51.170" end="00:53.134" ttm:agent="v1">She seen my status, now she wanna ****</p>
      <p begin="00:53.134" end="00:55.637" ttm:agent="v1">Try to convince me that you not a dub</p>
      <p begin="00:55.637" end="00:57.432" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe if you come through</p>
      <p begin="00:57.432" end="00:59.488" ttm:agent="v1">I'll see what's true and see what's up</p>
      <p begin="00:59.488" end="01:02.078" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty ho gon' ask me if I'm famous</p>
      <p begin="01:02.078" end="01:05.817" ttm:agent="v1">Gas got me sedated, put my blunt out on the pavement</p>
      <p begin="01:05.817" end="01:09.528" ttm:agent="v1">She said she in love, I fell in love with my hiatuses</p>
      <p begin="01:09.528" end="01:13.562" ttm:agent="v1">Julie think I'm conceited but askin' what the latest been</p>
      <p begin="01:13.562" end="01:15.935" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know, just chasing it, huh</p>
      <p begin="01:15.935" end="01:17.980" ttm:agent="v1">I really need me a bad bitch, um</p>
      <p begin="01:17.980" end="01:19.774" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty with similar habits, um</p>
      <p begin="01:19.774" end="01:21.657" ttm:agent="v1">Sex, money, drugs, you can have it, um</p>
      <p begin="01:21.657" end="01:23.531" ttm:agent="v1">She need to know she a bad bitch, yeah</p>
